---
import LandingLayout from "../layouts/LandingLayout.astro";
const brandName = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_BRAND_NAME || "Relifish";
---
<LandingLayout
  title={`Delivery & Shipping Policy · ${brandName}`}
  description={`How delivery and pickup work on ${brandName}: local sellers deliver within their own radius in Thane, South Mumbai and Navi Mumbai. Same-day or next-day, fees shown before you pay.`}
>
  <div class="legal-page">
    <div class="legal-header">
      <h1>Delivery &amp; Shipping Policy</h1>
      <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: 22 October 2026</p>
    </div>
    <div class="legal-body">
      <h2>1. Who delivers</h2>
      <p>{brandName} is a marketplace and does not deliver orders itself. Orders are fulfilled by the independent local seller you order from. The seller delivers the order to your address, with their own staff or a courier or bike-taxi service they book (for example, Porter), or keeps it ready for pickup at their shop, as you choose at checkout (where the seller offers that option). Orders are not shipped outside the sellers' local areas.</p>

      <h2>2. Where we deliver</h2>
      <p>Sellers on {brandName} currently serve parts of Thane, South Mumbai (Tardeo) and Kamothe (Navi Mumbai). Each seller sets their own delivery radius. When you set your location, you only see sellers who can deliver to you or whose shop you can collect from.</p>

      <h2>3. When you receive your order</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Same-day orders:</strong> placed while the seller is open. The seller confirms, prepares and delivers the same day, or keeps it ready for pickup.</li>
        <li><strong>Pre-orders:</strong> placed for a later day, up to the seller's limit of 1 to 3 delivery days ahead. The seller's page shows which days you can choose. The seller confirms and delivers, or keeps it ready, on the day you chose.</li>
        <li><strong>Delivery slots:</strong> for delivery orders, you pick a slot at checkout (for same-day orders, at least 2 hours ahead). The slot is the seller's target window, not a guaranteed time. The seller may change it when accepting your order, or set an "arriving by" time when sending it out, and you'll be notified. Pickup has no slot.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>You can follow the status of your order (paid, confirmed, out for delivery or ready for pickup, completed) on your order tracking page. For delivery timing, message us and we'll check with the seller.</p>

      <h2>4. Delivery charges</h2>
      <p>Delivery fees are set by each seller (a flat fee or a per-km fee, and some sellers deliver free above an order amount). The delivery fee and the seller's minimum order, if any, are shown at checkout before you pay. Pickup has no delivery charge.</p>

      <h2>5. Failed or delayed delivery</h2>
      <p>If the seller cannot fulfil your order, they will decline or cancel it and you get a full refund to your original payment method, usually within 5 to 7 working days. If a delivery is late or something is wrong, message us (below) and we'll check with the seller. See also our <a href="/refund-policy">Refund &amp; Cancellation Policy</a>.</p>
      <!-- FOUNDER DECISION (draft, not live): refund rules for changed or late slots are not decided yet. Proposed line:
      <p>If the seller changes your slot and the new time doesn't work for you, message us and we'll arrange cancellation with a full refund.</p>
      -->

      <h2>6. Contact</h2>
      <p>WhatsApp <a href="https://wa.me/919152207607">+91 9152207607</a> · <a href="mailto:relifishstore@gmail.com">relifishstore@gmail.com</a> · 7:30 AM to 9 PM. <a href="/contact">Contact page</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</LandingLayout>
